I haven't added the `http-client` import or the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause is its entire authority, and this grant isn't in the graph definition yet. The fetch would also send each customer's question to an external host, which is the kind of egress the capability model is meant to block. Once the graph and the `with` clause are updated, the import can be added in a follow-up. The files below implement the node with only the granted capabilities, `kb-read` and `tool-llm`.

